Rules:
  [R1] Use Rails conventions over configuration.
  [R2] Use Active Record for ORM.
  [R3] Use RESTful routing.
  [R4] Use service objects for business logic.
  [R5] Use concerns for shared code.
  [R6] Use Hotwire for interactivity.
  [R7] Use Sidekiq for background jobs.
  [R8] Use RSpec for testing.

